<title>USA: Quest Diagnostics issues $150 mln high-yield debt.</title>
<headline>Quest Diagnostics issues $150 mln high-yield debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt offering from Quest Diagnostics Inc was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER QUEST DIAGNOSTICS INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 10.75	MATURITY 12/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 6/15/1997 LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10.75	 PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD 411 BPS    CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
